          "database_id": 4333410185,
          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Use the compatibility-map format for absent evidence**\n\nFor this task-specific reservation, the Evidence check in `.github/workflows/governance-gate.yml` runs `scripts/check-evidence.py --task OPS-012`, but that parser recognizes absent canonical entries only as three-column table rows in `EVIDENCE-STRUCTURE.md`; these plain `name: N/A/reason` lines are ignored. The check therefore reports six missing entries (`screenshots/`, `api-samples/`, `migration-report/`, `performance/`, `security/`, and `rollback-verification/`) and fails the mandatory gate. Add the supported compatibility table or create nonempty canonical directories.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L231-L243](https://github.com/ElectricDogCN/Guize/blob/d05f0341e2b006c24668e48b3b8fce9bcb70478e/AGENTS.md#L231-L243)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->",
