          "database_id": 4333410191,
          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Represent the empty contract list with a supported sentinel**\n\nWhen `scripts/check-schemas.py` cross-checks this Task Spec against the new Active Work entry, the literal `''` is not recognized as an empty-list sentinel: `parse_front_list` performs its `NONE_VALUES` test before stripping quotes and consequently returns `['']`. The committed registry has `producesContracts: []`, so `python scripts/check-schemas.py` fails with `Task Spec OPS-012 producesContracts=[''] does not match Active Work producesContracts=[]`; use `[]` or `NONE` here.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->",
