          "database_id": 4333410198,
          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Bind the handoff to the published source**\n\nOnce this reservation commit exists, leaving `Commit/tree/PR` as pending means an interrupted reviewer or implementer cannot determine from the handoff which immutable source was reviewed; the branch named elsewhere can move, and the commit message's source identifier is not part of the recovery contract. Record the actual commit/tree identity in this handoff before integration rather than relying on out-of-band context.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L363-L367](https://github.com/ElectricDogCN/Guize/blob/d05f0341e2b006c24668e48b3b8fce9bcb70478e/AGENTS.md#L363-L367)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->",
